cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository helps you, you may cite it as below. It is an informal,
  work-in-progress synthesis of published research, written with Claude, an AI
  assistant by Anthropic. It is not an official standard, not peer-reviewed,
  and not a new result.
title: "business (work in progress)"
abstract: >-
  The front page of a family of repositories on business and economics: the business a venture needs, the economics that serves it, and behavioural economics. The map, the shared words, and the rule of one repository per problem with nothing private. Scope only.
type: software
